      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see. I can investigate this further where we can find an extra bit in favorable cachelines to store it.\n\nFor the helper we have it as `mm_pte_shift()` in [p3s/mm.h](https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/kernel/common/+/4312459/9/include/linux/p3s/mm.h)\n\n```\nstatic inline unsigned int mm_pte_shift(const struct mm_struct *mm)\n{\n\treturn (mm \u0026\u0026 mm-\u003econtext.pte_shift) ? mm-\u003econtext.pte_shift :\n\t\t\t\t\t       PAGE_SHIFT_KERNEL;\n}\n```",
